---
import PixelGarden from './PixelGarden.astro';
import { site } from '../../content/site';
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero__heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">{site.name} / {site.role}</p>
    <h1>Frontend.<br />Con criterio.</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__intro">
    <p>Construyo productos que tienen que aguantar producción.</p>
    <span>Angular, microfrontends e inteligencia artificial. De la arquitectura al último detalle.</span>
    <a href="/como-trabajo/">Así trabajo <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
  </div>
  <PixelGarden />
  <aside class="hero__aside">
    <span class="hero__arrows" aria-hidden="true">↓<br />↓<br />↓</span>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Desde {site.location}</p><p>Ingeniería sólida.<br />Ideas en movimiento.</p></div>
    <a href="/experiencia/">Explora mi experiencia <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </aside>
</section>
<style>
  .hero {display:grid;grid-template-columns:7fr 3fr;scroll-margin-top:64px}
  .hero__heading {padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem) var(--gutter) 3rem;min-height:400px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
  h1 {font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:clamp(4rem,8.6vw,8.5rem);font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.98;margin-top:3rem}
  .hero__intro {background:var(--color-bg-soft);border-left:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:1.5rem}
  .hero__intro>p {font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2vw,1.9rem);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  .hero__intro>span {font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .hero__intro a,.hero__aside>a {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:1rem}
  a span {transition:transform .25s}a:hover span {transform:translate(3px,3px)}
  .hero__aside {padding:2rem 2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;border-left:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .hero__arrows {line-height:1.3;color:var(--color-text-dim)}
  .hero__aside div>p:last-child {font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.3;margin-top:1rem}
  @media(max-width:720px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero__heading{min-height:340px}.hero__intro{border-left:0;padding:2rem var(--gutter)}.hero__aside{display:none}h1{font-size:clamp(3.8rem,13vw,6rem)}}
</style>
